      "hizbQuarter": 120,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2196,
      "text": "We do not send the messengers except as bearers of glad tidings and warners. But those who disbelieve seek to undermine the truth with false arguments, and they take My verses and warnings in ridicule.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 300,
      "ruku": 259,
      "hizbQuarter": 120,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2197,
      "text": "Who could be more wrong than one who is reminded of the verses of his Lord, but he turns away from them and forgets what his hands have sent forth? We have placed veils on their hearts so that they cannot understand it, and deafness in their ears. Even if you call them to guidance, they will never be guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 300,
      "ruku": 259,
      "hizbQuarter": 120,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2198,
      "text": "But your Lord is the All-Forgiving, Lord of Mercy. If He were to take them to task for what they did, He would have hastened their punishment. Yet there is an appointed time for them from which they will find no escape.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 300,
      "ruku": 259,
      "hizbQuarter": 120,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2199,
      "text": "Those are the towns We destroyed when they persisted in wrongdoing, and We set an appointed time for their destruction.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 300,
      "ruku": 259,
      "hizbQuarter": 120,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2200,
      "text": "And [remember] when Moses said to his servant, “I will not give up until I reach the junction of the two seas, or I travel for ages.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 300,
      "ruku": 260,
      "hizbQuarter": 120,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2201,
      "text": "But when they reached the junction of the two seas, they forgot their fish, which made its way into the sea, slipping away.",
